# repo tooling output
/build/
# the reports a scan writes where it is run (`lazaret-report.json`/`.html` under the scan root; a source scan's
# `lazaret-github-owner-repo-0123456-report.json`/`.html`, registry/sourcescan.py): output, never committed
lazaret-report.json
lazaret-report.html
lazaret-*-report.json
lazaret-*-report.html
# lazaret-registry's state database where --db is not given (and SQLite's WAL files)
lazaret-registry.db
lazaret-registry.db-*

